{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-26T06:16:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1916013416592118200"],"id":"1916013416592118200","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":944,"impression_count":1247803,"like_count":2746,"quote_count":40,"reply_count":279,"retweet_count":142},"text":"跟日本妹子打个炮可以得到多高的情绪价值？\n尽管做爱的过程中，\n日本妹子全程都会反复询问你感受开启话痨模式，\n但是该说不说，\n她们的情绪价值给的也确实到位，\n见面之后先会问你年龄，\n然后你告诉她之后，她就会跟惊讶的说，\n“哇！完全看不出来耶”\n找酒店不管定的多简陋的酒店，她都会说，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1916013416592118200"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-25T05:44:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1915642969321070757"],"id":"1915642969321070757","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":680,"impression_count":2135457,"like_count":2143,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":275,"retweet_count":91},"text":"跟有些日本妹子打炮是真的是麻烦，\n干点啥都要问你这样行不行…\n进房间就问洗澡还是不洗澡，\n要不要一起洗，\n洗的时候又问我是自己洗还是帮我洗…\n洗完帮我擦身子又问我劲是不是太大了，\n我一把把毛巾夺过来，\n跟她说你不用劲根本擦不干…\n上床问我灯要不要调暗一点，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1915642969321070757"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-25T01:20:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1915576526227333136"],"id":"1915576526227333136","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":117323,"like_count":117,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"昨天在名古屋带你们直播了一圈名古屋荣和锦的citywalk，有没看到直播的我等剪辑一下发到会员视频里。\n不过昨天直播效果确实还可以，我感觉可以经常去各地的风俗区带你们citywalk。 https://t.co/bM6SgNh2KX","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1915576526227333136"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-23T13:13:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1915031150961234241"],"id":"1915031150961234241","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":141216,"like_count":258,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":55,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我计划大阪搞个酒吧，\n给会员提供一些线下服务。\n到大阪之后不知道咋玩的，\n直接去店里就有人帮你搞定。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1915031150961234241"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-23T07:29:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1914944819916394791"],"id":"1914944819916394791","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":305199,"like_count":128,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":4},"text":"都让我多招人，问题这行的人是真的不好找。\n想来你这干活的90%都是冲着可以经常打炮来的…\n剩下的那些要不就啥也不会，\n要不就啥都明白，\n啥也不会的我也不知道从哪教你，\n啥都会的那些，\n都是老油条了，实在是搞的太花花了，\n我也怕出点啥事牵扯到我，\n毕竟我弄这个只是想给会员提供方便，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1914944819916394791"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-22T04:37:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1914539027430060502"],"id":"1914539027430060502","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":119469,"like_count":72,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"大阪世博会的中国馆建的还是霸气 https://t.co/hFRvC9j2x7","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1914539027430060502"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-21T14:56:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1914332511079203221"],"id":"1914332511079203221","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":163,"impression_count":381329,"like_count":565,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":56,"retweet_count":17},"text":"认识几个日本门槛妹，也不能算门槛吧，和乞丐也差不多，平时晚上去大久保公园站站。\n被客人带去酒店了，就让客人给她拍点床上照片，或是自己穿着酒店cos衣服对镜自拍。然后发在自己的推上。\n推特置顶的位置，会贴上自己的paypay收款码，\n收款码到期了就换一张。\n就这种简单操作，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1914332511079203221"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-21T08:18:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1914232300558303335"],"id":"1914232300558303335","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":121331,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1913637717570904098","type":"quoted"}],"text":"街头乞丐也没有说自己家缠万贯的啊… https://t.co/muVmrdpdud","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1914232300558303335"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-20T14:29:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1913963242105545093"],"id":"1913963242105545093","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":354,"impression_count":532881,"like_count":737,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":24},"text":"神户福原泡泡浴整体偏幼女风啊…外国人的话，只要可以说日语，所有的店都可以接待。不会说日语的话能接的店没有几家。\n但这里的女孩子真的是小到让你怀疑她们到底成没成年…😟 https://t.co/YoPKcha7vM","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1913963242105545093"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-19T06:19:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1913477646463516987"],"id":"1913477646463516987","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":73997,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"突然发现自己有台车半年没开了…\n然后电瓶没电打不着火了🥲","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1913477646463516987"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-18T02:26:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1913056582679843279"],"id":"1913056582679843279","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":47,"impression_count":152026,"like_count":209,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":4},"text":"之前一直不爱动弹，现在要陪一些大哥参加他们的朋友局。\n不喜欢露脸，一进局就是躲角落里吃菜。大哥挨个介绍，介绍到我，基本桌子上所有人眼睛都亮了...\n那种关注度，能明显感觉和生意场上那种点头之交不一样，他们是真心想交我这朋友...\n但是没一个敢主动加我微信，\n必须是饭局上地位最高的那个人， https://t.co/nvKLs3sgb6","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1913056582679843279"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-17T03:38:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1912712365109572086"],"id":"1912712365109572086","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":66,"impression_count":220963,"like_count":389,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":9},"text":"怎么判断一个男的是理论派还是实践派，就是你问他要不要找两个女的3p的时候，他开始给你认真的科普：两男一女才叫3p，两女一男叫双飞。\n这种就是理论派，天天网上看一堆没用的科普，装作自己啥都明白，结果了解的都是些不能出海的伪知识，自己想实践时候还没钱没资源。\n实践派就一个字：走！","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1912712365109572086"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-16T12:58:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1912490694163488895"],"id":"1912490694163488895","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":104104,"like_count":99,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"吃饭吃两个小时，都给我吃困了...😞 https://t.co/8VDdp2xomp","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1912490694163488895"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-16T06:23:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1912391296439943544"],"id":"1912391296439943544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":98,"impression_count":155745,"like_count":352,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":15},"text":"现在的妹子约个炮有多拼，\n前几天x上约的线下见面，聊天的时候跟我说可能那几天会来生理。\n我也没当回事，就说一起吃个饭就好。\n结果见面妹子跟我说没事，\n没来生理…\n还给我看了她买的药，貌似贴上生理就会不来…\n这一通输出，\n说的我不干点啥都感觉不好意思了…\n果真印证那句话， https://t.co/tJaI64Hsus","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1912391296439943544"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-16T04:51:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1912368277499834441"],"id":"1912368277499834441","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":68536,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"周末去趟大阪看看世博会。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1912368277499834441"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-15T06:19:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1912027948078497868"],"id":"1912027948078497868","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":231,"impression_count":99062,"like_count":433,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":32},"text":"视频剪完了，带你们了解一下，一个视频带你们了解一下日本男性按摩（メンエス）的整个流程。\n完整高清版的在tg频道里发布，感谢@_kanon_gs 同志的出演，后面的视频拍摄还在继续探讨之中。 https://t.co/XCKHx0zbqY","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1912027948078497868"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-14T03:29:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1911622876828237950"],"id":"1911622876828237950","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":482,"impression_count":505147,"like_count":981,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":126},"text":"这么看我这条赛道选的没啥问题… https://t.co/0ZxAKaUoif","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1911622876828237950"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-12T12:55:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1911040435675680923"],"id":"1911040435675680923","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":129,"impression_count":131159,"like_count":391,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":7},"text":"今天和@_kanon_gs 拍了一个日本男性按摩的视频，主要是把一些截图用于新书的插图。\n整个视频我到时候也会剪辑出来发到tg群里，让你们有一个更直观的了解。 https://t.co/K7Prq0C58a","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1911040435675680923"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-12T08:07:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1910968006647398571"],"id":"1910968006647398571","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":135259,"like_count":127,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"16万粉的X在日本接日本公司的推广居然能要到三万人民币一条…😳","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1910968006647398571"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-11T10:25:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1910640438769586655"],"id":"1910640438769586655","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":93329,"like_count":108,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":1},"text":"好久没来吉原了，高中同学来带着去玩了一圈，\n感觉就是好的店依旧牛逼，垃圾的店依旧垃圾。\n那些动辄七八万日元的，能接中国人的高级店，有一家算一家，质量离那几家两三万日元的大众店差远了…\n吉原没人带确实找不到好的店铺，\n但有人带了，你会发现还不如没人带…🙂 https://t.co/h4XuwFsYZE","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1910640438769586655"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-11T04:19:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1910548179210428870"],"id":"1910548179210428870","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":100220,"like_count":98,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":3},"text":"新书小样印出来一本。插图还没拍，版也没排。全搞完估计能挺厚的。\n圈子里会员不用单独买，风俗百科里除了图片，大部分文字内容基本都有。 https://t.co/GM7orcY3GW","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1910548179210428870"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-10T02:24:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1910156954082943180"],"id":"1910156954082943180","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":622,"impression_count":967979,"like_count":1082,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":58,"retweet_count":67},"text":"昨天跟一个日本哥们聊天时候跟我说，日本妹子的价格，已经被日本男性根据妹子类型定义好了。\n那种プス系的是最底层，也就3000到10000日元、\n其次是ぴえん系，也就那样地雷系量产系的，价格在10000到20000日元之间，\n泡姬系的，也就是泡泡浴那些类型，长相普通但服务很好的，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1910156954082943180"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-09T07:05:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1909865309223502243"],"id":"1909865309223502243","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":228872,"like_count":115,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在外漂泊了二十多天，终于回日本了，继续开始寻欢作乐☺️ https://t.co/8x4rlvIqwZ","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1909865309223502243"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-08T02:41:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1909436453962354935"],"id":"1909436453962354935","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":121740,"like_count":107,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这几天在韩国呆着，明显感觉海外游客是有，但中国游客明显少了不少。\n唯一看到的几个中国游客也是一些上岁数的大爷大妈，在公共场所不管不顾的拿着手机横冲直闯。\n一看就是跟着船过来的廉价团。\n但不得不说，韩国旅游确实太便宜了。\n吃的便宜，奢侈品便宜，美容便宜，酒店便宜，夜总会便宜， https://t.co/VLpdeuH47Y","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1909436453962354935"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-04-06T00:33:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1908679494107553883"],"id":"1908679494107553883","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":139,"impression_count":246400,"like_count":305,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":13},"text":"韩国这边经纪跟我说韩国玩的价格太低了，想把韩国的价格做上去。\n我就很疑惑，飞日本的韩国妹子价格明明挺高的啊，怎么在本土价格反而低这么多。\n经过几天在韩国的活动，有了一个简单的理解。\n那就是韩国这地方没有太多的周边娱乐。\n永登浦玻璃房全是岁数大的，\n外国人价120000韩币， https://t.co/l4YWFB3HCW","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1908679494107553883"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1477219258195054593","created_at":"2025-04-19T16:56:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1913637717570904098"],"id":"1913637717570904098","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":244132,"like_count":651,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":18},"text":"我真求你们有钱的门槛妹别天天卖惨说自己吃不起饭了穿个裙子八千多说吃不起饭是什么意思"}],"users":[{"id":"222316578","name":"梁","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772826334999502848/ZdX2uBog_normal.jpg","username":"iam678","verified":false},{"id":"1477219258195054593","name":"我是南海观世音菩萨","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2102415841879040001/WkXkqoD-_normal.jpg","username":"Melodyunovo","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1916013416592118200","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fsbw9xdzgatwiqbo6aart56juvozul","oldest_id":"1908679494107553883","result_count":25}}